  "sentences": [
    {
      "text": "Hey.",
      "speaker_name": "Stuart Tiedeman",
      "start_time": 4.56,
      "end_time": 4.88
    },
    {
      "text": "Hello, Andy.",
      "speaker_name": "Stuart Tiedeman",
      "start_time": 4.88,
      "end_time": 5.76
    },
    {
      "text": "Hey, D.",
      "speaker_name": "Andrew Day",
      "start_time": 6.24,
      "end_time": 6.88
    },
    {
      "text": "Hello.",
      "speaker_name": "Andrew Day",
      "start_time": 8,
      "end_time": 8.48
    },
    {
      "text": "Hi, John.",
      "speaker_name": "Stuart Tiedeman",
      "start_time": 9.04,
      "end_time": 9.68
    },
    {
      "text": "Hi, John.",
      "speaker_name": "Andrew Day",
      "start_time": 10.16,
      "end_time": 10.72
    },
    {
      "text": "How you doing?",
      "speaker_name": "Andrew Day",
      "start_time": 10.72,
      "end_time": 11.28
    },
    {
      "text": "I'm good, thank you.",
      "speaker_name": "jon",
      "start_time": 11.68,
      "end_time": 12.8
    },
    {
      "text": "Oh, no Matt today.",
      "speaker_name": "Andrew Day",
      "start_time": 14.56,
      "end_time": 15.76
    },
    {
      "text": "No.",
      "speaker_name": "Stuart Tiedeman",
      "start_time": 16.24,
      "end_time": 16.52
    },
    {
      "text": "His son is doing university visits, so his wife's working.",
      "speaker_name": "Stuart Tiedeman",
      "start_time": 16.52,
      "end_time": 20.64
    },
    {
      "text": "So he got the short straw taking him around and about.",
      "speaker_name": "Stuart Tiedeman",
      "start_time": 20.64,
      "end_time": 22.8
    },
    {
      "text": "So he apologizes, but sends his regards.",
      "speaker_name": "Stuart Tiedeman",
      "start_time": 22.8,
      "end_time": 24.88
    },
    {
      "text": "I think that's the long straw, isn't it?",
      "speaker_name": "Andrew Day",
      "start_time": 25.12,
      "end_time": 26.68
    },
    {
      "text": "Spending time with your son and going to universities.",
      "speaker_name": "Andrew Day",
      "start_time": 26.68,
      "end_time": 28.8
    },
    {
      "text": "That sounds great.",
      "speaker_name": "Andrew Day",
      "start_time": 28.8,
      "end_time": 29.6
    },
    {
      "text": "Yeah.",
      "speaker_name": "Andrew Day",
      "start_time": 30.11,
      "end_time": 30.51
    },
    {
      "text": "Yeah, it's a long straw.",
      "speaker_name": "Andrew Day",
      "start_time": 30.59,
      "end_time": 31.83
    },
    {
      "text": "Yeah, it's a good point.",
      "speaker_name": "Stuart Tiedeman",
      "start_time": 31.83,
      "end_time": 32.91
    },
    {
      "text": "Okay, good on him.",
      "speaker_name": "Andrew Day",
      "start_time": 35.55,
      "end_time": 36.59
    },
    {
      "text": "Just checking that we haven't got any updates in the last day or so.",
      "speaker_name": "Andrew Day",
      "start_time": 36.59,
      "end_time": 42.75
    },
    {
      "text": "Let me just check.",
      "speaker_name": "Andrew Day",
      "start_time": 42.75,
      "end_time": 43.87
    },
    {
      "text": "I read John the update about Omnicom's Hagarth stepping to one side for now.",
      "speaker_name": "Stuart Tiedeman",
      "start_time": 49.71,
      "end_time": 57.42
    },
    {
      "text": "And the bottom feeder for the cool coat.",
      "speaker_name": "Stuart Tiedeman",
      "start_time": 57.42,
      "end_time": 61.54
    },
    {
      "text": "And the.",
      "speaker_name": "Andrew Day",
      "start_time": 67.22,
      "end_time": 67.74
    },
    {
      "text": "The bottom feeder for Coolco Tool Company.",
      "speaker_name": "Andrew Day",
      "start_time": 67.74,
      "end_time": 71.3
    },
    {
      "text": "You called him a bottom feeder.",
      "speaker_name": "Stuart Tiedeman",
      "start_time": 71.699,
      "end_time": 73.14
    },
    {
      "text": "Oh, yeah.",
      "speaker_name": "Andrew Day",
      "start_time": 73.22,
      "end_time": 73.82
    },
    {
      "text": "Because of his.",
      "speaker_name": "Andrew Day",
      "start_time": 73.82,
      "end_time": 74.42
    },
    {
      "text": "Yeah, he's.",
      "speaker_name": "Andrew Day",
      "start_time": 75.06,
      "end_time": 76.98
    },
    {
      "text": "He's hoped that he can lowball.",
      "speaker_name": "Andrew Day",
      "start_time": 77.06,
      "end_time": 78.98
    },
    {
      "text": "Yeah.",
      "speaker_name": "Stuart Tiedeman",
      "start_time": 79.86,
      "end_time": 80.42
    },
    {
      "text": "Which is a bit crazy.",
      "speaker_name": "Andrew Day",
      "start_time": 80.66,
      "end_time": 81.86
    },
    {
      "text": "Yeah, I am chasing him up on that because he is, he's a good option, obviously.",
      "speaker_name": "Andrew Day",
      "start_time": 81.86,
      "end_time": 85.91
    },
    {
      "text": "Yeah, I agree.",
      "speaker_name": "Stuart Tiedeman",
      "start_time": 86.31,
      "end_time": 87.11
    },
    {
      "text": "And also, I'm not really.",
      "speaker_name": "Andrew Day",
      "start_time": 87.75,
      "end_time": 89.83
    },
    {
      "text": "I'm not really sure what he feels that we would do as a.",
      "speaker_name": "Andrew Day",
      "start_time": 91.11,
      "end_time": 93.79
    },
    {
      "text": "As an M A advisory either, that we would just go, oh, we've given up, so let's go and, and get a really rubbish offer from you and, and we'll do that.",
      "speaker_name": "Andrew Day",
      "start_time": 93.79,
      "end_time": 102.95
    },
    {
      "text": "That's a bit crazy.",
      "speaker_name": "Andrew Day",
      "start_time": 103.91,
      "end_time": 104.99
    },
    {
      "text": "But also, we don't really know how bad that.",
      "speaker_name": "Andrew Day",
      "start_time": 104.99,
      "end_time": 108.31
    },
    {
      "text": "I mean, it could be in his opinion, it could be appalling, but it could actually be a decent offer.",
      "speaker_name": "Andrew Day",
      "start_time": 108.31,
      "end_time": 113.3
    },
    {
      "text": "So, yeah, so I am chasing him.",
      "speaker_name": "Andrew Day",
      "start_time": 113.38,
      "end_time": 116.82
    },
    {
      "text": "I've probably sent him four or five emails and just trying to get him on a call so we can figure out what, what it would look like.",
      "speaker_name": "Andrew Day",
      "start_time": 116.82,
      "end_time": 123.7
    },
    {
      "text": "Yeah, so we'll see.",
      "speaker_name": "Andrew Day",
      "start_time": 124.34,
      "end_time": 125.86
    },
    {
      "text": "Anyway, that's, that's where we are on that.",
      "speaker_name": "Andrew Day",
      "start_time": 125.86,
      "end_time": 128.02
    },
    {
      "text": "We don't seem to have had any signed NDA since we last spoke.",
      "speaker_name": "Andrew Day",
      "start_time": 128.02,
      "end_time": 132.38
    },
    {
      "text": "And I spoke to Ahmed about an hour ago.",
      "speaker_name": "Andrew Day",
      "start_time": 132.38,
      "end_time": 136.18
    },
    {
      "text": "And our strategy now is to just build up a list of new targets that are potentially much smaller than the ones that we have been speaking to.",
      "speaker_name": "Andrew Day",
      "start_time": 136.26,
      "end_time": 147.07
    },
    {
      "text": "So we've been going after like bigger companies, thousand or so people, but I guess with the reality that maybe the multiple is not going to be what we initially talked about, that actually some smaller companies could be in the running and we have excluded them up until now.",
      "speaker_name": "Andrew Day",
      "start_time": 147.07,
      "end_time": 166.75
    },
    {
      "text": "So we're going to, we're going to reach out to those smaller companies and see whether we can get interest.",
      "speaker_name": "Andrew Day",
      "start_time": 166.75,
      "end_time": 172.67
    },
    {
      "text": "So that's the, the current strategy, but I guess we're pretty much up to date beyond that.",
      "speaker_name": "Andrew Day",
      "start_time": 172.83,
      "end_time": 179.23
    },
    {
      "text": "So Erica is taking a look at the.",
      "speaker_name": "Andrew Day",
      "start_time": 179.31,
      "end_time": 184.03
    },
    {
      "text": "The latest version of the documents that have gone up that were shared on Tuesday, I think, although we don't.",
      "speaker_name": "Andrew Day",
      "start_time": 185.47,
      "end_time": 192.83
    },
    {
      "text": "We can't see that she's downloaded them yet, but she does know that they're there.",
      "speaker_name": "Andrew Day",
      "start_time": 193.32,
      "end_time": 196.68
    },
    {
      "text": "Brilliant.",
      "speaker_name": "Stuart Tiedeman",
      "start_time": 197.72,
      "end_time": 198.36
    },
    {
      "text": "So that is moving along.",
      "speaker_name": "Andrew Day",
      "start_time": 198.76,
      "end_time": 200.52
    },
    {
      "text": "She said she would speak to Steve today and then they're going to go to the CEO.",
      "speaker_name": "Andrew Day",
      "start_time": 200.6,
      "end_time": 207.84
    },
    {
      "text": "I explained this in the email.",
      "speaker_name": "Andrew Day",
      "start_time": 207.84,
      "end_time": 208.999
    },
    {
      "text": "Didn't I say?",
      "speaker_name": "Andrew Day",
      "start_time": 208.999,
      "end_time": 209.8
    },
    {
      "text": "Yeah.",
      "speaker_name": "Stuart Tiedeman",
      "start_time": 210.2,
      "end_time": 210.76
    },
    {
      "text": "So basically there's not a huge difference between an IOI and an loi, but it is a more casual approach and she mentioned IOI a few times.",
      "speaker_name": "Andrew Day",
      "start_time": 211.24,
      "end_time": 219.96
    },
    {
      "text": "I don't know why it's more casual because it is in effect it's the same thing.",
      "speaker_name": "Andrew Day",
      "start_time": 221.18,
      "end_time": 225.26
    },
    {
      "text": "It's basically an indication of interest.",
      "speaker_name": "Andrew Day",
      "start_time": 225.26,
      "end_time": 230.3
    },
    {
      "text": "Ends up being.",
      "speaker_name": "Andrew Day",
      "start_time": 231.1,
      "end_time": 231.9
    },
    {
      "text": "Exactly.",
      "speaker_name": "Andrew Day",
      "start_time": 231.9,
      "end_time": 232.38
    },
    {
      "text": "There isn't like another step to go to an loi.",
      "speaker_name": "Andrew Day",
      "start_time": 232.38,
      "end_time": 234.62
    },
    {
      "text": "It is exactly the same, but obviously it is slightly more laid back approach.",
      "speaker_name": "Andrew Day",
      "start_time": 235.26,
      "end_time": 239.18
    },
    {
      "text": "And because of that they can get the agreement from the CEO to move forward with an IOI and it doesn't have to go up to an investment committee or the board.",
      "speaker_name": "Andrew Day",
      "start_time": 239.26,
      "end_time": 249.85
    },
    {
      "text": "So.",
      "speaker_name": "Andrew Day",
      "start_time": 250.17,
      "end_time": 250.53
    },
    {
      "text": "But she mentioned it a few times that it would probably be an IOI from the CEO next week, which would Steve pitching it or Steve's blessing.",
      "speaker_name": "Andrew Day",
      "start_time": 250.53,
      "end_time": 260.25
    },
    {
      "text": "And then they would just take it to the CEO and say Steve's agreed.",
      "speaker_name": "Andrew Day",
      "start_time": 260.25,
      "end_time": 265.37
    },
    {
      "text": "So as long as the CEO signs it off, we would get an offer next week.",
      "speaker_name": "Andrew Day",
      "start_time": 265.93,
      "end_time": 269.29
    },
    {
      "text": "They're a NASDAQ organization, so I guess there is a lot of process and tiered hierarchical approaches to stuff, so it's understandable.",
      "speaker_name": "Stuart Tiedeman",
      "start_time": 270.49,
      "end_time": 279.21
    },
    {
      "text": "So that's exciting.",
      "speaker_name": "Stuart Tiedeman",
      "start_time": 279.37,
      "end_time": 281.29
    },
    {
      "text": "So thank you for that.",
      "speaker_name": "Stuart Tiedeman",
      "start_time": 281.37,
      "end_time": 282.21
    },
    {
      "text": "I'm going to send you the video for the Plan Hub Live brands, which we should have by Monday, if not by closer play today.",
      "speaker_name": "Stuart Tiedeman",
      "start_time": 282.21,
      "end_time": 290.329
    },
    {
      "text": "But that, that would be quite a good one for you to sort of forward on that.",
      "speaker_name": "Stuart Tiedeman",
      "start_time": 290.329,
      "end_time": 293.01
    },
    {
      "text": "Steve could watch.",
      "speaker_name": "Stuart Tiedeman",
      "start_time": 293.01,
      "end_time": 293.77
    },
    {
      "text": "It's only like three or four minutes long, but I think it does a good job of indicating where we're at.",
      "speaker_name": "Stuart Tiedeman",
      "start_time": 294.89,
      "end_time": 300.33
    },
    {
      "text": "And obviously we got our new contract signed off over the line.",
      "speaker_name": "Stuart Tiedeman",
      "start_time": 302.14,
      "end_time": 305.5
    },
    {
      "text": "I don't know if that's something that you would update them on as well.",
      "speaker_name": "Stuart Tiedeman",
      "start_time": 305.74,
      "end_time": 308.38
    },
    {
      "text": "Congratulations.",
      "speaker_name": "Andrew Day",
      "start_time": 308.7,
      "end_time": 309.58
    },
    {
      "text": "Yeah, well, I would be happy to go back to everybody, Coolco and Omnicom to say, you know, we've got another signed contract.",
      "speaker_name": "Andrew Day",
      "start_time": 309.58,
      "end_time": 317.34
    },
    {
      "text": "Yeah.",
      "speaker_name": "Stuart Tiedeman",
      "start_time": 317.82,
      "end_time": 318.3
    },
    {
      "text": "In the loop.",
      "speaker_name": "Andrew Day",
      "start_time": 318.54,
      "end_time": 319.34
    },
    {
      "text": "Yeah.",
      "speaker_name": "Stuart Tiedeman",
      "start_time": 319.58,
      "end_time": 320.06
    },
    {
      "text": "Imagine then maybe wait till we've got the brand video and you could sort of maybe send that out.",
      "speaker_name": "Stuart Tiedeman",
      "start_time": 320.86,
      "end_time": 326.26
    },
    {
      "text": "Plus the update on.",
      "speaker_name": "Stuart Tiedeman",
      "start_time": 326.26,
      "end_time": 327.5
    },
    {
      "text": "By the way, we've got another contract.",
      "speaker_name": "Stuart Tiedeman",
      "start_time": 327.5,
      "end_time": 328.7
    },
    {
      "text": "This has now been bought by Australia, Apex largest beers, wines and spirits vendor, which, yeah, it's good yeah.",
      "speaker_name": "Stuart Tiedeman",
      "start_time": 329.1,
      "end_time": 338.74
    },
    {
      "text": "How much is it worth?",
      "speaker_name": "jon",
      "start_time": 338.9,
      "end_time": 339.86
    },
    {
      "text": "Sorry?",
      "speaker_name": "jon",
      "start_time": 340.02,
      "end_time": 340.38
    },
    {
      "text": "Just sitting here, I can see Matt's emotes come through the endeavor.",
      "speaker_name": "jon",
      "start_time": 340.38,
      "end_time": 344.06
    },
    {
      "text": "Three year.",
      "speaker_name": "jon",
      "start_time": 344.06,
      "end_time": 344.54
    },
    {
      "text": "How much is that worth to us?",
      "speaker_name": "jon",
      "start_time": 344.54,
      "end_time": 345.86
    },
    {
      "text": "It's.",
      "speaker_name": "Stuart Tiedeman",
      "start_time": 348.34,
      "end_time": 348.9
    },
    {
      "text": "It's Australian dollars, so let me just.",
      "speaker_name": "Stuart Tiedeman",
      "start_time": 349.38,
      "end_time": 351.14
    },
    {
      "text": "It's 50, basically.",
      "speaker_name": "jon",
      "start_time": 352.42,
      "end_time": 353.94
    },
    {
      "text": "Yeah.",
      "speaker_name": "Stuart Tiedeman",
      "start_time": 354.34,
      "end_time": 354.7
    },
    {
      "text": "It's 24 times 36 plus 25.",
      "speaker_name": "Stuart Tiedeman",
      "start_time": 354.7,
      "end_time": 357.22
    },
    {
      "text": "It's about £450,000.",
      "speaker_name": "Stuart Tiedeman",
      "start_time": 360.58,
      "end_time": 362.42
    },
    {
      "text": "Is that over the three years?",
      "speaker_name": "jon",
      "start_time": 363.78,
      "end_time": 365.06
    },
    {
      "text": "Yeah, over three years.",
      "speaker_name": "jon",
      "start_time": 365.3,
      "end_time": 367.94
    },
    {
      "text": "Yeah.",
      "speaker_name": "Stuart Tiedeman",
      "start_time": 368.18,
      "end_time": 368.66
    },
    {
      "text": "But that's not including a cost for Insights, and they're also paying for enhancements on top.",
      "speaker_name": "Stuart Tiedeman",
      "start_time": 370.18,
      "end_time": 377.3
    },
    {
      "text": "So it should.",
      "speaker_name": "Stuart Tiedeman",
      "start_time": 377.54,
      "end_time": 378.74
    },
    {
      "text": "Should go to well over half a million, I would have thought.",
      "speaker_name": "Stuart Tiedeman",
      "start_time": 378.74,
      "end_time": 382.58
    },
    {
      "text": "Half a million divided by three.",
      "speaker_name": "jon",
      "start_time": 383.3,
      "end_time": 385.3
    },
    {
      "text": "Yeah.",
      "speaker_name": "Andrew Day",
      "start_time": 386.14,
      "end_time": 386.46
    },
    {
      "text": "Okay.",
      "speaker_name": "jon",
      "start_time": 386.86,
      "end_time": 387.42
    },
    {
      "text": "That's what I just wanted now.",
      "speaker_name": "jon",
      "start_time": 388.62,
      "end_time": 389.62
    },
    {
      "text": "I just saw it come up now.",
      "speaker_name": "jon",
      "start_time": 389.62,
      "end_time": 390.62
    },
    {
      "text": "Okay, thank you.",
      "speaker_name": "jon",
      "start_time": 390.62,
      "end_time": 391.66
    },
    {
      "text": "That's all right.",
      "speaker_name": "Stuart Tiedeman",
      "start_time": 391.66,
      "end_time": 392.38
    },
    {
      "text": "Good.",
      "speaker_name": "Stuart Tiedeman",
      "start_time": 392.46,
      "end_time": 392.86
    },
    {
      "text": "All right, Andy.",
      "speaker_name": "Stuart Tiedeman",
      "start_time": 393.02,
      "end_time": 393.82
    },
    {
      "text": "Well, that's very clear, mate.",
      "speaker_name": "Stuart Tiedeman",
      "start_time": 393.82,
      "end_time": 394.7
    },
    {
      "text": "Let's cross everything and see what they come out with.",
      "speaker_name": "Stuart Tiedeman",
      "start_time": 394.7,
      "end_time": 397.98
    },
    {
      "text": "Yeah.",
      "speaker_name": "Andrew Day",
      "start_time": 398.62,
      "end_time": 399.06
    },
    {
      "text": "Fingers crossed.",
      "speaker_name": "Andrew Day",
      "start_time": 399.06,
      "end_time": 399.98
    },
    {
      "text": "Thank you.",
      "speaker_name": "Stuart Tiedeman",
      "start_time": 401.579,
      "end_time": 402.1
    },
    {
      "text": "All right.",
      "speaker_name": "Stuart Tiedeman",
      "start_time": 402.1,
      "end_time": 402.62
    },
    {
      "text": "I guess we'll.",
      "speaker_name": "Stuart Tiedeman",
